 Baseline simulation: mirror matches with mixed vanilla creatures,
 powerless generals, identical decks. Measures first-player advantage
 with all other variables eliminated.

 We say:

Section: Card Pool

  base-gem : CardTemplate
  base-gem = make-basic-gem 0 "Topaz" 1 8

  creature-1-1 : CardTemplate
  creature-1-1 = make-creature 1 "Scout" (light-cost-y 1) 1 1 0 keywords-none

  creature-1-2 : CardTemplate
  creature-1-2 = make-creature 2 "Guard" (light-cost-add (light-cost-y 1) (light-cost-w 1)) 1 2 0 keywords-none

  creature-2-1 : CardTemplate
  creature-2-1 = make-creature 3 "Striker" (light-cost-add (light-cost-y 1) (light-cost-w 1)) 2 1 0 keywords-none

  creature-2-2 : CardTemplate
  creature-2-2 = make-creature 4 "Veteran" (light-cost-add (light-cost-y 1) (light-cost-w 2)) 2 2 0 keywords-none

